3. What is the range of the relation
{ (1, 3), (2, 4), (3, 5) }

A) { 1, 2, 3 }
B) { 3, 4, 5 }
C) { 1, 3, 5 }
D) { 2, 3, 4 }

ANSWER
B

4. What is the domain of the relation
{ (4, 5), (6, 7), (8, 9) }

A) { 4, 5, 6 }
B) { 5, 7, 9 }
C) { 4, 6, 8 }
D) { 6, 7, 8 }

ANSWER
C
